    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.04900731875030773,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場の店主たちはトラック",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.16665435555606825,
      "width": 0.17969345644230678,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の荷下ろしを始め",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1306861548078071,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。この市",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.24833319161356765,
      "width": 0.08167885317330749,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.330012027671067,
      "width": 0.01633578432730796,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "は1948年から",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.10935165704478371,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ポプラ通りの4",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.22699869385054428,
      "width": 0.10904125768993214,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ブロックで開かれており、近所",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.24974964842467293,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22739388754302403,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の人によれば、70",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2686890415749253,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.13633832910018526,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年以上のあ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2686890415749253,
      "left": 0.2539853759368835,
      "width": 0.08167885317330753,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いだ一度も休んだことがないと",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28762843472517785,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いう。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3065678278754304,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.04900731875030773,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "現在の出店数は約140で、10",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3378178265733471,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21770679078336203,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "年前の85から大きく増えた。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35675721972359953,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2180171751886224,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市の2023年の調査によると、",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3756966128738521,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22317928306176987,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "通",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.39463600602410454,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.016335784327307982,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "常の週末には約12,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.39463600602410454,
      "left": 0.13398282113306847,
      "width": 0.14042226809714184,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "000人が",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.39463600602410454,
      "left": 0.27440507557625876,
      "width": 0.06565347884103141,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "訪れ、地域経済に年間およそ4",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4135753991743571,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22290155172026294,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "億2000万円の効果をもたらし",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.43251479232460965,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22366935951193817,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ている(",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4514541854748621,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.06534308596180761,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "近",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4514541854748621,
      "left": 0.18299012276756813,
      "width": 0.016335784327307982,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "くのカフェや商店の",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4514541854748621,
      "left": 0.19932588997906797,
      "width": 0.14653184556913862,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "売り上げは含まない)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.47039357862511466,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.16335768923080685,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.47039357862511466,
      "left": 0.2769207927915964,
      "width": 0.012251833966528933,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「みんな、私たちが野菜を売っ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5016435773230313,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ていると思っているんです」",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5205829704732838,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.21007796767628537,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "と、ここで27年間青果店を営",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5395223636235364,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2180171751886224,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "む岡田真理子さんは言う。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5584617567737888,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.19602922365380662,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "「本",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5584617567737888,
      "left": 0.30959232721459623,
      "width": 0.028587601178028794,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "当に売っているのは、街の中心",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5774011499240415,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22739388766557297,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "に出かける理由なんですよ」",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.596340543074294,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.20942455115939346,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.596340543074294,
      "left": 0.32298765472018304,
      "width": 0.012251833966528933,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "一番の売れ筋は、今も1袋200",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6152799362245465,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22366934948100045,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "円のミックスリーフだそうだ。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.634219329374799,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2265771123319583,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数字も彼女の言葉を裏付けてい",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6664162977302284,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946374
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "る。市の開かれる日の歩行者数",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6853556908804809,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "はほかの土曜日より38%多",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7042950840307334,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.19996615927408137,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "く、来",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.723234477180986,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.04900731875030773,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "場者の4人に3人が近所",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.723234477180986,
      "left": 0.16665435555606825,
      "width": 0.1690425415674674,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の別の店にも立ち寄ったと答え",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7421738703312385,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "た。県立大学の経済学者である",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7611132634814911,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "白井教授は、これを「波及効",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7800526566317435,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2123649908653065,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "果」と呼んでいる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7980450801244834,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1460417692415192,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "もちろん、良いことばかりでは",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8302420484799127,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.22870075807680643,
      "height": 0.012623105439946356
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ない。出店料は今年1月に1日",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8491814416301652,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.2180171751886224,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "3,500円から5,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8681208347804178,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.11214505898124127,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "000円に値上げ",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.8681208347804178,
      "left": 0.2297920992488583,
      "width": 0.11466078047553104,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "され、古くからの店主の中には",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.15505268267341019,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.228700758076806,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "負担が重いと話す人も",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.17399207582366275,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.16335768923080674,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "いる。最",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.17399207582366275,
      "left": 0.5489849599687627,
      "width": 0.06534308596180755,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "も多い苦情は駐車場だ。最寄り",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.19293146897391528,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.228700758076806,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "の公共駐車場は220台分しか",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.21187086212416784,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21267538374452988,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "なく、たいてい午前9時15分に",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.23081025527442037,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.22835771568913868,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "は満車になる。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.24974964842467293,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.11435038759630721,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市議会は、5月1日から10月",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.28099964712258946,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.20733359230043796,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "31日まで、さらに2ブロックを",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29993904027284196,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.22770428042224758,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "車両通行止めにする案を検討し",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3188784334230945,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.228700758076806,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ている。賛成派は40店分のス",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3378178265733471,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.21804984320196663,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "ペースが増えると主張し、反対",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.35675721972359953,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.22592367706506697,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "派は配送や高齢者の移動への影",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.3756966128738521,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.228700758076806,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "響を心配している。最近はQR",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.39463600602410454,
      "left": 0.3856272878537643,
      "width": 0.2202878387601593,
      "height": 0.012623105439946337
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "コードで支払う若い客も増え",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4135753991743571,
